  "title": "Battle of Marathon",
  "summary": "In 490 BCE an Athenian army, reinforced by Plataea, defeated a Persian invasion force on the plain of Marathon. Livius gives about 25,000 Persians against some 10,000 Athenian hoplites; Herodotus counted 6,400 Persian and 192 Athenian dead. The Spartans arrived too late to take part.",
